# Code owner review is required only for these paths (.github/rulesets/main.json). Everything else, the pipeline,
# the gate and the tooling included, merges on the required checks and codex-review alone: those changes are tested
# by the pipeline itself. Risk paths: anything that writes hardware registers, touches calibration, or signs,
# verifies or boots an update.

# Hardware register writes and the board model (FPGA, AFE, ADC, clocks, triggers, sequencer), including the
# unit-specific calibration (calfile, selfcal, coretrim), which cannot be regenerated.
/hal/src/dho/ @ichnograph
/hal/src/target.rs @ichnograph
/hal/src/model.rs @ichnograph
/hal/src/vendorkeys.rs @ichnograph
/fpgad/ @ichnograph

# Update packages, signing keys, kexec and boot.
/hal/src/update/ @ichnograph
/hal/src/bootstatus.rs @ichnograph
/keys/ @ichnograph
/boot/ @ichnograph
/kernel/ @ichnograph
/rootfs/ @ichnograph
